{
    "comment": [
        "Every piece of code generated during the ACTS build, keyed by where the",
        "generated file lives inside a pre-generated code directory.",
        "",
        "This file is the single source of truth. cmake/ActsCodegen.cmake reads it to",
        "drive acts_code_generation, and CI/pregenerate_codegen.py reads it to produce",
        "the files ahead of a build, so the two cannot disagree about what exists or",
        "about where a given file belongs.",
        "",
        "All paths are relative to the ACTS source root.",
        "",
        "  script            generator to run; it is passed the output path as argv[1]",
        "  output            path the compiler includes, relative to the generated",
        "                    include root added to the consuming target",
        "  with_requirements requirement files to install before running the script",
        "  with              packages to install before running the script",
        "  isolated          run the generator without inheriting the ambient",
        "                    environment's packages",
        "  python_version    interpreter to run the generator with"
    ],
